# JWT Authentication API

A JWT-based authentication REST API built with Node.js, Express, and MongoDB. Implements access/refresh token rotation, HTTP-only cookies, role-based access control (RBAC), input validation, email verification, and centralized error handling.

---

## Tech Stack

| Layer | Technology |
|-------|------------|
| Runtime | Node.js (ESM — `"type": "module"`) |
| Framework | Express 5 |
| Database | MongoDB via Mongoose 9 |
| Auth | JSON Web Tokens (`jsonwebtoken`) |
| Password hashing | bcrypt |
| Validation | express-validator |
| Email | nodemailer |
| HTTP logging | Morgan |
| Cookie parsing | cookie-parser |
| Config | dotenv |

---

